    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Realistic three-masted Dutch merchant ship with a planked hull, wales, bowsprit, carved beakhead, stern gallery, deck fittings, capstan, hatches, channels and shrouds, three masts with yards, tops and partially furled canvas sails, and standing rigging. Hull planking and rigging read correctly from both sides, the deck is fully fitted from above and the underwater hull and rudder are complete.",
    "limitations": [
      "Very large real-world scale; check scene units before placing next to characters.",
      "Sails are static geometry in a fixed partially-furled state, not simulated cloth.",
      "Not rigged in the shipped glTF; masts and yards do not articulate."
    ],
